1
00:00:00,058 --> 00:00:02,558
Oh, I should probably get going.

2
00:00:02,727 --> 00:00:06,727
(Leonard:)-Come on, it's just a cup of coffee.
-Yeah. Okay.

3
00:00:11,778 --> 00:00:13,448
[WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]

4
00:00:13,613 --> 00:00:17,453
(Howard(to Raj, who has whispered to him):)Yeah, the whole thing
seems a little twisted to me too.

5
00:00:18,159 --> 00:00:19,449
(Leonard:)What am I smelling?

6
00:00:19,619 --> 00:00:21,869
(Penny:)Sheldon's churro on my shoes.

7
00:00:37,428 --> 00:00:39,768
(Penny:)Such an angel when he's asleep.

8
00:00:40,849 --> 00:00:44,389
(Leonard:)Yeah, shame he has to wake up.

9
00:00:46,896 --> 00:00:49,106
(Penny:)I think we can do it.

10
00:00:49,357 --> 00:00:52,737
(Leonard:)Smother Sheldon in his sleep?
Wouldn't that be wrong?

11
00:00:53,778 --> 00:00:57,118
(Penny:)No, be friends. You and me.

12
00:00:57,282 --> 00:01:00,032
(Leonard:)Oh, sure.

13
00:01:00,201 --> 00:01:01,911
(Leonard:)Absolutely.

14
00:01:02,078 --> 00:01:04,748
(Sheldon:)Good. I'm glad.

15
00:01:05,623 --> 00:01:09,873
(Leonard:)Here's an idea. I'm just throwing it
out there. Friends who have sex.

16
00:01:12,130 --> 00:01:14,090
(Penny:)Good night, Leonard.

17
00:01:14,257 --> 00:01:18,637
(Leonard:)Kidding. Just a couple of friends
goofing around.

18
00:01:19,053 --> 00:01:21,023
(Sheldon(in his sleep):)No, Goofy, no.

